'''Benjamin Kirby "Ben" Tennyson''', also known as '''Alien Force Ben''',{{Refn|[[:File:Tinction (2752).png]]|group = credits}} is an alternate version of [[Ben Tennyson (Reboot)|Ben]]. He is a representation of 15-year-old [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Tennyson]] from '''[[Ben 10: Alien Force (TV Series)|Ben 10: Alien Force]]'''.

==Appearance==
Ben's appearance is older and somewhat different from his reboot counterpart. His outfit consists of a black shirt, blue jeans, and a green jacket with white stripes and the number 10 on it, and black and white Converse-style shoes.

Ben wears the reconfigured [[Omnitrix (Reboot)|Omnitrix]] on his left wrist.

==Personality==
Compared to the other teenage Bens, '''Alien Force''' Ben is more serious and less prone to immaturity despite being the youngest of the teenage Bens, but he is no less heroic or compassionate than his counterparts.

He is also brave, caring, good-natured, responsible, sensible, kind-hearted, cunning, resourceful, and selfless.

==History==
===Ben 10===
'''Alien Force''' Ben first appears in ''[[Alien X-Tinction]]'', where he was sent by the [[Plumbers (Reboot)|Plumbers]] to travel across the [[Omniverse]] to find out who was stealing Omnitrixes. '''Alien Force''' Ben arrives in [[Dimension 27998.3]] as [[Chromastone (Reboot)|Chromastone]]. Introducing himself to [[Team Tennyson (Reboot)|Team Tennyson]] and [[Maximilian Tennyson|Maximilian]], he explains that he was sent by the Plumbers to pursue [[Alien X (Reboot)|Alien X]]. [[Gwen Tennyson (Reboot)|Gwen]] gets the idea to use '''Alien Force''' Ben as bait to lure the Alien X into a trap. Ben even agrees with the plan, instructing Maximilian to find an alternate Omnitrix in the meantime.

'''Alien Force''' Ben accompanies Team Tennyson to [[Adrenaland]], where they begin setting up a trap for Alien X. When they are done, he explains to Gwen that her counterpart in his dimension has a thing for magic and Kevin. When Alien X shows up, Ben smart talks him before transforming into [[Big Chill (Reboot)|Big Chill]], luring Alien X into the trap. The trap does not work for long and Big Chill is defeated. Fortunately, Maximilian returns with [[Ben Tennyson (Ultimate Alien Homage Dimension)|'''Ultimate Alien''' Ben]]. Ben assumes the new arrival is the same as the other teen Ben until he shows off his [[Ultimatrix (Reboot)|Ultimatrix]].

Transforming into Chromastone again, '''Alien Force''' Ben battles Alien X once more, this time with '''Ultimate Alien''' Ben as [[Ampfibian (Reboot)|Ampfibian]]. After a short battle, Chromastone retreats from Adrenaland while carrying Gwen in his arms. Before timing out, Chromastone blasts a runaway Ferris wheel. Ben and Maximilian arrive with help from [[Ben Tennyson (Original Series Homage Dimension)|Original Series Ben]], [[Ben Tennyson (Omniverse Homage Dimension)|'''Omniverse''' Ben]], and [[Gwen Tennyson (Gwen 10 Dimension)|Gwen 10]], just in time to stop Alien X from removing the omnitrix from '''Alien Force''' Ben.

Turning into Big Chill again, '''Alien Force''' Ben saves Ben from a raining boulder and tries to fight Alien X to no avail. Ben eventually convinces everyone to fight Alien X at the same time. As Chromastone, '''Alien Force''' Ben is able to synchronize his powers with his counterparts and remove the alternate Omnitrices from Alien X's right wrist. After Alien X is defeated, '''Alien Force''' Ben congratulates Ben on saving the Omniverse before returning to his home dimension.

