==Trivia==
[[File:AF Ben RB.png|120px|thumb|Stripes only on one sleeve]]
*This Ben's design is a stylized version of 15-year-old [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Prime]]'s regular appearance in '''Alien Force''' except that he has white stripes on both sleeves of his jacket whereas Prime Ben's jacket only had stripes his right sleeve.
**One scene shows this Ben lacking the white stripes on his left sleeve, better mirroring Ben Prime's appearance.
*'''Alien Force''' Ben's inclusion in the reboot was first hinted when [[Duncan Rouleau]] dropped vague hints on what to expect for Season 5.{{Refn|[[:File:Duncan's crossover ideas.png]]|group = DR}}
*'''Alien Force''' Ben is the only alternate Ben featured in ''Alien X-Tinction'' to use more than one alien.
* Duncan Rouleau originally stated that the four alternate Bens featured in ''Alien X-Tinction'' are the same as [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Prime]] from the previous four series.{{Refn|group=DR|[[:File:All Alternate Bens are Classic Ben.png]]}} However, he later rescinded that statement, stating that they are from alternate timelines.{{Refn|[[:File:AXT Bens are not Prime.png]]|group = DR}} 
**[[Cartoon Network]] already indicated this, when it said in the description of a video that '''Alien Force''' Ben and [[Ben Tennyson (Ultimate Alien Homage Dimension)|'''Ultimate Alien''' Ben]] are from different dimensions.{{Refn|https://youtu.be/6aZT9D1S5Oc|group = CN}}

